<title>USA: Chesapeake Utilities names CFO.</title>
<headline>Chesapeake Utilities names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DOVER, Del. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chesapeake Utilities Corp on Monday said it named Michael McMasters chief financial officer.</p>
<p>McMasters succeeds John Schimkaits, who remains executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Most recently, McMasters was general manager and vice president of Chesapeake's Eastern Shore Natural Gas Co.</p>
